\item The elements $t_{2,\pi}  ,  \sigma(t_{2,\pi} ), \varphi (t_{2,\pi} )$ and $ \varphi \circ \sigma (t_{2,\pi} )  $ are invertible in $B_{\textnormal{crys},F}$.
