{\rm ord}_p\biggl(\frac{L'(E,1)}{{\rm Reg}(E/{\mathbb Q})\cdot\Omega_E\cdot\prod_\ell c_\ell(E/\bQ)}\biggr)&-{\rm ord}_p(\#\sha(E/{\mathbb Q}))\\
&=
