\label{cuspbl2}
\source{birational-section-conjecture-strong-birationality}
    The following are equivalent.
    \begin{itemize}
        \item The cuspidalization conjecture holds.
        \item For every smooth, geometrically connected hyperbolic curve $X$ over a field $k$ finitely generated over ${\mathbb Q}$, every Galois section of $X$ is birationally liftable.
    \end{itemize}

