\item[(2)] For any torsion multi-section ${\mathcal T}\subset {\mathcal A}$, the line bundle ${\mathcal L}|_{{\mathcal T}}$ is torsion in ${\rm Pic}({\mathcal T})$.
\item[(3)] If ${\mathcal L}$ is symmetric and $\pi$-ample, then ${\mathcal L}$ is nef over ${\mathcal A}$. 
\item[(4)] If ${\mathcal L}$ is symmetric and $\pi$-ample, and ${\mathcal L}'$ is another symmetric and rigidified line bundle over ${\mathcal A}$, then there is a positive integer $a$ such that $a{\mathcal L}-{\mathcal L}'$ is nef over ${\mathcal A}$. 
\end{itemize}

