&=& {\psi_V}_* \tilde{f}_* \phi_V^! ([\frak W' \times V])\\
&= &{(\psi_V \tilde{f})}_* \phi_V^! ([\frak W' \times V])\, ,
\end{eqnarray*}
which is the required equality.

