\Phi_{a}(x)&= \frac{1-\exp({-\frac{a}{2}}x)}{x}\\ &= \sum_{m=0}^\infty (-1)^m (\frac{a}{2})^{m+1} \frac{1}{(m+1)!}x^m = \frac{a}{2} - \frac{a^2}{8} x + \ldots 
