\source{geometric-local-systems-general-curves-isomonodromy}
Suppose $W_\star= (W,\{ W^i_j\}, \{\alpha^i_j\})$ is a parabolic bundle on $C$ with respect to a reduced divisor $D=x_1+\cdots+x_n$.
